# WS3-07. Sources: spec/10-modules.md MOD-4/MOD-8 (each module has its own names; a
# private name in two modules does not clash) and spec/17-codegen.md §1/§7 (one valid
# C99 unit; user names must not collide). Two modules each declare `handle Res`; the
# program must build and drop b then a. Host only (strdup instrument, as in WS2).
profiles: host
expect: output
contrast: let b = makeB(); ==> let b = makeA();
contrast-expect: output
--- output
end
drop B
drop A
--- contrast-output
end
drop A
drop A
